35,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"The delivery windows for scanning equipment are unreliable, but bench tooling ships quickly.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Yumi,,"The outer wards lost bus links, making access to staffed counters very difficult.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,George,,"The vehicle running costs overran significantly, but the equipment allocation was under budget.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,"Former outreach stops had higher attendance than the main building, but the digitisation project stalled.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"We have retired tradespeople volunteering, but no staff are trained to supervise outside facilitators.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@George, does the equipment overrun mean we can't afford new tools for a workshop?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"@May, if outreach worked better, why did we stop it?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,George,,"The grant only covers session fees for twelve months, then it falls to the operating budget.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,"The partner-run groups still meet, but the digitisation batch left half the images unindexed.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"The technician who certified the power tools retired, so we lack that specific skill.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"The winter road closures shut access for eleven days, which is a major risk for mobile services.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Yumi,,"Evening room bookings are full, but remote catalogue use peaks after the library closes.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,George,,This confirms my fear; the funding shape is fragile after the first year.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,"We need to avoid repeating the digitisation mistake, but the outreach model seems viable.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,We need to find a way to train staff or rely on the volunteers for supervision.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
